          "title": "Generalized PPO unifies LLM reinforcement learning through the lens of divergence",
          "summary": "GRPO and DAPO-style variants differ mainly in advantage normalization and clipping choices. The paper derives conditions under which each variant matches plain PPO, backed by controlled comparisons.",
